== Notes ==
*The bonus does not count against the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].

==Builder notes==
'''Item feat:''' No, but it can be added with custom content.

* Technically, this feat grants a bonus just to attacks made with [[dart]]s, [[shuriken]]s, or [[throwing axe]]s. The bonus to attacks made with [[sling]]s is hardcoded to the halfling race (but there is no indication to the player of this).
* When using the <code>dm_enablecombatdebugging</code> [[console command]], the bonus for slings is listed as "Halfling Sling Bonus", while that for the other throwing weapons is listed as "Good Aim".

==Custom content notes==
'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' yes

'''Script:''' hardcoded

*This feat can be added to [[iprp_feats.2da]] to make it available as an item feat.